# Architecture

Vertical slices in **Application**. **Core** = entities + SQL schema scripts. **Infrastructure** = EF, MailKit, Foundry (ports + `DTOs.cs` per concern). **Application** = Features, AI, app services. **WebApp** = Blazor UI + HTTP host. **MediatR** (`lib/MediatR`) = CQRS — not the Jimmy Bogard NuGet package.

## Solution layout

```text
lib/MediatR/            CQRS dispatcher — see lib/MediatR/README.md
src/Core/               Entities/ + Database/ (schema scripts, manual migrations)
src/Infrastructure/     Persistence, Mailbox/, Foundry/ + AddInfrastructure()
src/Application/        Features/, AI/, Models/, Services/, Utilities/ + AddApplication()
src/WebApp/             Components/, Endpoints/, UI models, composition root (Startup)
```

**References:** `Infrastructure → Core` · `Application → Infrastructure` + `MediatR` · `WebApp → Application`

## Where new code goes

| Question | Place |
|----------|--------|
| DB table / domain field | `Core/Entities/` (POCOs) + `Core/Database/dbo/Tables/` (SQL — no data annotations on entities; validate on `Request`) |
| Manual schema migration | `Core/Database/Migrations/` (ALTER scripts for existing DBs; keep `dbo/Tables/` in sync) |
| Seed data | `Core/Database/Seed/` |
| Mailbox port + models | `Infrastructure/Mailbox/` (`Abstractions.cs`, `DTOs.cs`, `Helpers.cs`, `MailKitMailboxService`) |
| Foundry port + config | `Infrastructure/Foundry/` (`Abstractions.cs`, `DTOs.cs`, `Helpers.cs`, `FoundryAgentFactory`) |
| Use case (Request/Handler) | `Application/Features/{Slice}/Commands\|Queries/{UseCase}.cs` |
| Slice read shape | `Application/Features/{Slice}/DTOs.cs` |
| Cross-slice read shape | `Application/Features/Shared/DTOs.cs` |
| Slice data access | `Application/Features/{Slice}/Repository.cs` |
| Cross-slice data access | `Application/Features/Shared/Repository.cs` |
| `Result`, pipeline, `IMediator` | `lib/MediatR/` |
| AI turn shapes, app constants | `Application/Models/` |
| LLM, tools, orchestration, memory | `Application/AI/` |
| Cross-slice mailbox facade | `Application/Services/UserMailboxService.cs` |
| App crypto / email-read helpers | `Application/Utilities/` |
| Blazor UI | `WebApp/Components/` |
| HTTP API | `WebApp/Endpoints/*Endpoints.cs` |
| UI-only models (routes, tabs) | `WebApp/Models/` |

**Not in WebApp:** `AppDbContext`, entities, handlers, repositories.

## Application folders

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| **Features/** | Vertical slices + `Shared/` — see `feature-slice-conventions.mdc` |
| **AI/** | Agents, tools, `ChatOrchestrator`, `Memory/` — see `ai-conventions.mdc` |
| **Models/** | `AI.cs`, `ChatMessageRoles`, etc. — see `dto-conventions.mdc` |
| **Services/** | `UserMailboxService` and future cross-slice app services |
| **Utilities/** | Cryptography, email-read helpers (not Blazor/UI) |

## WebApp folders

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| **Components/** | Blazor — see `blazor-conventions.mdc` |
| **Models/** | `AuthConstants`, `SettingsSection` — UI/routing only |
| **Endpoints/** | MVC `*Endpoints.cs`; `/api/...` only |
| **Utilities/** | Auth cookie/helpers, `CurrentUser`, Blazor display helpers |

## Startup (`Startup.cs`)

- `InjectData` → `AddInfrastructure(configuration)` + `CurrentUser`
- `AddApplication(configuration)` → repos, MediatR, AI, `UserMailboxService`

## Foundry

`Foundry:Enabled`, `Foundry:Endpoint`, `Foundry:ApiKey` in user secrets / env — never commit keys.

